      "message": "[error] Line 136: 🔴 `waitForData()` receives an error_code, but this path treats every non-positive result as a successful EOF and ignores `ec`. If the socket reports a real transport error here, libgit2 will see a clean end-of-stream and may treat a truncated pack as success or report a misleading error later. Check `ec` immediately after `waitForData()` and return `-1` with `giterr_set_str(GITERR_NET, ec.message().c_str())` before handling the timeout/zero-data EOF case.",
